1.7.0: super8ify - the one-command reel, with sound

scripts/super8ify.sh: phone clip in, 1970s reel out. Video through
superjuice (18 fps, 720p proxy, Kodachrome 64, age 0.25 by default),
audio through audiotard's tape chain (wow 14 cents, flutter 10, hiss,
tube drive, projector-speaker bandwidth) when installed - the first
official bridge between the two repos. Everything is an environment
knob; SILENT=yes gives the period-correct silent reel, and inputs
without audio degrade gracefully. The script finds its sibling
superjuice binary repo-relative first, then PATH.

README introduces the audiotard companionship.
